---
import { brand, cta } from "../../data/site";
---

<header class="media-hero">
	<div
		class="press-stage"
		data-accent
		data-accent-mode="hang"
		aria-label="Saturday Down South press credential, gently swinging"
	>
		<div class="press-stage__chrome" aria-hidden="true">
			<span>Credential</span>
			<span>SDS</span>
		</div>

		<span class="press-cord" data-cord="sds" aria-hidden="true"></span>

		<div class="accent-body press-pass" data-accent-body="sds">
			<span class="press-pass__eye" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<div class="press-pass__body">
				<span class="press-pass__kicker">Press · Media</span>
				<span class="press-pass__title">Saturday Down South</span>
				<span class="press-pass__meta">Co-founder</span>
			</div>
			<div class="press-pass__stub">
				<span>SEC</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="press-stage__legend" aria-hidden="true">
			<span>Co-founder</span>
			<span class="press-stage__dot"></span>
			<span>SEC football</span>
			<span class="press-stage__dot"></span>
			<span>Orlando</span>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="media-hero__copy">
		<p class="archive__eyebrow"><span class="archive__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Archive / Media</p>
		<h2 class="archive__title media-hero__title">
			<span>Saturday</span>
			<span>Down</span>
			<span class="media-hero__accent">South</span>
		</h2>
		<p class="archive__lede media-hero__lede">
			Not only software. Early co-founder work on an SEC college-football publisher — audience,
			shipping cadence, and media ops that still shape how products get built.
		</p>
		<p class="media-hero__hint">One credential · soft swing</p>
	</div>
</header>

<aside class="media-facts" aria-label="Verified media facts">
	<div class="media-fact">
		<span class="media-fact__label">Role</span>
		<span class="media-fact__value">Co-founder</span>
	</div>
	<div class="media-fact">
		<span class="media-fact__label">Property</span>
		<span class="media-fact__value">Saturday Down South</span>
	</div>
	<div class="media-fact">
		<span class="media-fact__label">Lane</span>
		<span class="media-fact__value">SEC college football</span>
	</div>
	<div class="media-fact media-fact--accent">
		<span class="media-fact__label">Entity</span>
		<span class="media-fact__value">Saturday Football, Inc.</span>
	</div>
</aside>

<div class="story-block" data-media-story>
	<blockquote class="story-quote">
		<p>
			{brand.name} is one of the three co-founders of Saturday Down South, the SEC college football
			publisher.
		</p>
	</blockquote>

	<div class="story-copy">
		<p>That chapter is audience work — not a claim about current day-to-day leadership.</p>
		<p>
			It still matters for clients: he has shipped to a real public, not only to repositories. The
			archive pairs that media instinct with Laravel packages, growth systems, and on-chain tooling.
		</p>
		<nav class="story-links" aria-label="Saturday Down South links">
			<a href="https://www.saturdaydownsouth.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
				saturdaydownsouth.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="https://www.saturdaydownsouth.com/author/drew/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				Author archive <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
			</a>
			<a href={cta.bookHref}>{cta.bookLabel}</a>
		</nav>
	</div>
</div>
